# The controller reports whether the drawn eye is in a water cell, in walk and
# fly mode; scene.js switches to the underwater fog and tint on it. The raft
# scene's water fills y = 49..64 and the player spawns with its eye above it.

case the spawn eye is above the surface
start walk raft
frame 50 x2
expect underwater = false

case flying down through the surface goes underwater, and back up leaves it
start walk raft
click
lock
press KeyF
expect mode = fly
down ShiftLeft
frame 50 x6       # 10 blocks a second: about 2.5 blocks down after the trailing tick
up ShiftLeft
frame 50 x2
expect eye.y < 64
expect underwater = true
down Space
frame 50 x8
up Space
frame 50 x2
expect eye.y > 64
expect underwater = false

case outside any loaded region is never underwater
start fly
frame 50 x2
expect underwater = false
